  "finalText": "I've cancelled the wireless mouse on Marcus Ade's order O-2003 and refunded £73.50 to his card. The rest of the order is still set to ship as planned.\n\n- **Checks first:** O-2003 is Marcus's order (C-200). The mouse was on one line only (L1, product P-MOU, 2 units), and it hadn't shipped. That makes it a cancellation, not a return.\n- **Cancelled:** Only the mouse line.\n- **Refunded:** RF-1, £73.50 to his card. That's what he was actually charged for the mouse. The MOUSE25 discount on the order means this is less than the £98.00 list price for two mice (2 × £49.00).\n- **Stock:** The mouse wasn't backordered, so stock had been held for it. I put both units back, and mouse stock went from 30 to 32.\n- **Rest of the order:** The hub (1 unit) and cable (3 units) lines are unchanged and still due to ship. The shipping address (5 Kingfisher Court, Leeds LS2 7EE, UK) is the same, and the order is still \"pending\". The order now shows £73.50 refunded out of £199.50 paid.",
